#%RAML 1.0 Library
usage: |
  Common error envelope, detail type, response trait, and example payloads
  shared by every e-commerce API (System, Process, Experience). Error codes
  use the business-domain prefix convention — see error-handling-strategy.md
  §4 for the full taxonomy. Domain prefixes:
    - CTLG — Catalog (products). v1.
    - CART — Cart. v2 (Experience).
    - ORDR — Orders. v2.
    - INVT — Inventory. v3.
  The envelope shape is defined in error-handling-strategy.md §3.1 and MUST
  stay in lockstep with this library.
types:
  ErrorResponse: !include types/ErrorResponse.raml
  ErrorDetail:   !include types/ErrorDetail.raml
traits:
  hasErrors: !include traits/has-errors.raml
